            <li>ItemSO: ScriptableObject that contains item information such as sprites and what type it is (mushroom, eyeball etc)</li>
            <li>IItemParent: If attached to gameobject, it can be used as a parent for an item. For example counters can have items on it and players can hold items.</li>
